  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Scan of the 1956 edition of the Portland West, Maine, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey, the U.S. Army Corps of Engineers, and the Army Map Service. Surveyed in 1944; aerial photographs from 1975; field checked in 1956; photo revised in 1978; last revised in 1978; printed in 1978.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 21.5 x 27.5 inches. Printed projection: Polyconic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
